{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi open world Shooter Game</strong>\u00a0with a Medieval Setting. You play as a Time Traveling Monster Hunter sent to cleans a Medieval World from all things that go bump in the night. Clear out monsters in different areas, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Play minigames to unlock new weapons. Collect loot drops to increase your abilities in battle. Combat varies from slow to intense depending on the area of the map. Mini games have an unreal tournament combat feel but in VR.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities: </strong>Speed Boost - Invincibility Shield - Time Dilation<strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up ability loot drops to enhance your combat abilities. Speed boost increases your max run speed for a limited time. Shield protects you from damage for a limited time. Use Time Dilation to slow time which also gives you the ability to steal fallen enemy weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/693bfc6e8d354d35672e2a5c16d80cd4.avif?t=1756576840\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons: </strong>Pistol, Shotgun, Rifle, Sword, Bow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/4ae9fc62f09e69c121720d5b80c0cfce.avif?t=1756576840\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> Pumpkin Spider - Freddy Pumpkin - Mutants - Zombie - Vampires - Skeletons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/db15b0b249ad86cf4f9793562707b324.avif?t=1756576840\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses: Mushroom Monster - Mutant - Reaper - Spyder Queen - Ancient One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/a175ca5abc32dcf9609b8e5203e8bfb1.avif?t=1756576840\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531950?t=1756576840","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756576840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/49f9d8239693a5ae38e2830209a671d96034aabb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756576840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/49f9d8239693a5ae38e2830209a671d96034aabb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756576840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Bloody Skeleton Enemies, Blood splatter on the ground and walls, enemy deaths include blood splatter."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi open world Shooter Game</strong>\u00a0with a Medieval Setting. You play as a Time Traveling Monster Hunter sent to cleans a Medieval World from all things that go bump in the night. Clear out monsters in different areas, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Play minigames to unlock new weapons. Collect loot drops to increase your abilities in battle. Combat varies from slow to intense depending on the area of the map. Mini games have an unreal tournament combat feel but in VR.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities: </strong>Speed Boost - Invincibility Shield - Time Dilation<stro